      "lines": [
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_001",
          "lineType": "effect",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "从梦境中迷迷糊糊地睁开眼睛。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "transition:eyes_open_blur",
          "orderIndex": 0,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_002",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "content": "？我这是怎么了？这是到哪来了？",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/confused",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 1,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_003",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "content": "头有点晕……怎么一下子什么都想不起来了……",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/confused",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 2,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_004",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "这时，一段记忆涌入你的脑海……",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 3,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_005",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "你是潘承洞，1934年5月26日出生于江苏苏州。读高中时你就曾发现《范氏大代数》中一道循环排列题的解答有误，并作出了改正。1952年，你考入北京大学数学力学系，四年后留校做研究生。1957年，你成为闵嗣鹤教授的研究生，研究L函数的零点分布及其在著名数论问题中的应用。后来，你参加华罗庚教授主持的哥德巴赫猜想讨论班，与陈景润、王元相识，常在一起讨论、学习和互相启发。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 4,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_006",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "现在，27岁、研究生毕业的你来到了山东大学。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 5,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_007",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "对了，我是来这里的数学系担任助教。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/normal",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 6,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_008",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "你走进了学校的大门。往后的一段时间里，你白天给学生们讲课，晚上灵感一来，又会冲到教室里进行自己的研究。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 7,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_arrival_009",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "至于研究方向，这也是你正在思索的……",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 8,
          "condition": null
        }
      ],
