      "lines": [
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_001",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "大筛法么……这便是我先前多次与王元兄探讨的了。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/focused",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 0,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_002",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "我曾研究过L函数零点分布，这让我对大筛法的使用更加得心应手，我先前也是因此才直觉得出θ应当取1/3。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/focused",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 1,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_003",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "王元兄便是不信这1/3，即便在我看来我的逻辑已经足够严密。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/focused",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 2,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_004",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "……那好，我便再证上一次！",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/determined",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 3,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_005",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "关于“1+5”，最开始，你将初步证明思路写信给了师兄王元，但得到的是对方的反驳。自此，你们开始了长达数月、累计60多封的长信论战。最终，王元被你的严密论证说服。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 4,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_a_break_006",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "1963年，你又证明了“1+4”；1966年，陈景润证明了“1+2”。这些成果使中国在哥德巴赫猜想研究中处于世界领先地位，被国际数学界公认为关键性突破。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 5,
          "condition": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "showInStoryline": false
    },
    {
      "code": "pan_b_act1",
      "type": "normal",
      "title": "第一幕 B线：转向应用",
      "entry": false,
      "progressPercent": 25,
      "backgroundRef": "pan/prologue/campus_road",
      "cgRef": null,
      "nextNodeCode": "pan_b_act2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_001",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "我到现在已经研究了许久的数论，它的确很让人着迷。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/thinking",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 0,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_002",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "可是现在国内做基础理论研究工作并不容易……大家看重现实意义本无可厚非，但说数论是“洋人的垃圾”实在是言之过矣……",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/serious",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 1,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_003",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "我始终相信数论是有用的，可现状如此……或许是我需要迈出一步。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/young/determined",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 2,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_004",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "1966年，国内基础理论研究工作受到严重冲击，你的研究工作一度无法正常进行。当时许多学者都选择将研究向更具应用性的方向调整。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 3,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_005",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "于是，你决定顺应形势，将研究方向从纯理论转向更具应用性的领域，其中包括样条函数理论和滤波分析。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 4,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_006",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "这是一次转型，必然会遇到我所陌生的东西。可无论研究什么，我都应当充分运用我原有的东西，让研究能落在实处。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/middle/focused",
          "effectRef": "cg:pan/common/review_materials",
          "orderIndex": 5,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_007",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "潘承洞",
          "content": "我会尽我所能。毕竟，如果接下来投入了时间却一事无成，那真的太不值了。我希望能改变些什么。",
          "portraitRef": "pan/middle/determined",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 6,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_b1_008",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "你在应用方面的研究，把扎实的数学功底用于解决当时国家需求和工程挑战的具体问题，体现了一种“将论文写在祖国大地上”的学术胸怀。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": "overlay:center_text_dark",
          "orderIndex": 7,
          "condition": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "showInStoryline": true
    },
    {
