        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_004",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "你找了个位置坐下，开始吃午饭，心中的情绪还未平复，脑子里仍想着刚才的事情。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 7,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_005",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "content": "脑子有些胀，好长的一个梦……在梦里，我居然成了潘承洞先生吗……",
          "portraitRef": "protagonist/thinking",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 8,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_006",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "content": "虽然跟我所了解过的故事不太一样，但或许因为都是“潘承洞先生”，所以无论我的选择与潘承洞先生是否一致，最后走向的结局也会与真实历史的性质相似……因为那就是潘承洞……",
          "portraitRef": "protagonist/thinking",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 9,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_007",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "content": "可感觉经历了那么多，似乎也不过是揭开了有关潘承洞先生的冰山一角。他曾做了那么多，而我平时能了解到的其实只有那么几个短短的陈述句……",
          "portraitRef": "protagonist/thinking",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 10,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_008",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "周围许多人在聊天，某些字眼进入耳中，引起了你的注意。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 11,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "pan_epilogue_009",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "学生A",
          "content": "哎，我高中同学在软件园校区的，说他们多了个密码学院。",
